From 3ffb3720057dea947e3171a88261409e498eb120 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 14:58:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(atelier-sfc): add compile feature for parse-only
 consumers

Split template/script codegen behind an optional `compile` feature so
linters that only call `parse_sfc` can drop DOM/Vapor/SSR and the oxc
transformer from this crate's graph. `native` still defaults on and
includes `compile` plus LightningCSS, so the published compiler is
unchanged.

`is_ts_lang` moves to `types` because Croquis prop merging needs it
without the compile modules.
